  Slug: the-mournful
  DisplayName: The Mournful
  IconPath: icons/environment/settlement/graveyard-tombstone-night.webp
  Description: To be a hero is to endure countless hardships and stand where others
    have fallen, shouldering dreams and destinies in their stead. Though this weight
    may reach your eyes, you bear this burden so that those under you can live smiling.
    You are trained in Diplomacy. After you Spark Transcendence, your act resonates
    with bittersweet poignancy, making one enemy of your choice within 30 feet who
    witnessed the act @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] as tears
    or memories dance in their eyes. This is an emotion and mental effect. The enemy
    remains dazzled until the start of your next turn, and then they are temporarily
    immune for 10 minutes.
